Salvatore Barbieri is a member of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]], an orc whose skin runs gray rather than green. He dresses in loose pants held by suspenders and a white shirt buttoned open down his chest, and he carries a great many guns around his hips and back. Several of them are welded to melee weapons: a gun on a sword, a gun on a hammer. He buys his ammunition, including bullets that swell into boulders when they strike, from a seller in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]].
